[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Testing the Netstorm Editor</h2>
<i>"The grim thing is that we prepare for war like gracious giants and for peace like retards"<br>
--Killdead The Great Prophet of Nimbus</i>  
<p>You have been caught with your allie in a trap you must fight your way out to survive!

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
Good job you and your allie have won!
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,nothinghereyet

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from Rahn</h2>
<p>
Oh no your allies temple is gone

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>Message from Rahn</h2>
<p>
You are now alone to face the enemy


[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Seems you took on foe to powerful for to handle.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


